subQuestions.memoText:
Mark 1: First reasonable suggestion ✓
Mark 2: Second reasonable suggestion ✓

Accept any TWO reasonable answers, e.g.
(1) collect rainwater into the tank during rainy periods;
(2) reduce daily usage by mulching the beds to keep moisture in;
(3) water early morning or evening to reduce evaporation;
(4) install drip irrigation;
(5) cover the soil with mulch to limit evaporation.
[1 mark each, max 2]
